    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you Ready for Grease Monkey Grand Prix?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race the most chaotic race of all time, the Grease Monkey Grand Prix, where you are your own one-man team of pitstop and racer. After your grandpa breaks his back, you must fill in for him, there\u2019s not much you need to learn and train, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One Man Pitstop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Minigames while racing to gain a minigame-appropriate Power-up and risk the chance of failing, where you will gain a power down. Are you able to multitask and gain the Title of Grease Monkey, or will you fall between the cracks of obscurity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Example:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uf0a7    Pick up the Minigame Box</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uf0a7    The slot machine will choose a minigame (e.g. TNT Minigame)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uf0a7    Mash Minigame Prompt to succeed, which drops a bomb behind you </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uf0a7    Enemy Racer Hits Bomb and Explodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uf0a7    Fail the minigame, and instead you\u2019ll blow up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which Car will you pick?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of cars with different Stats to pick from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race your Ghost</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your after-image ghost of your fastest lap will show up every race. can you beat yourself, or is that the best you can do?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race your Friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, Couch Co-op is included.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro Aesthetics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CRT? Check. Cell-Shading? Check. It looks gorgeous, and it took a long time to make.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you Ready for Grease Monkey Grand Prix?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race the most chaotic race of all time, the Grease Monkey Grand Prix, where you are your own one-man team of pitstop and racer. After your grandpa breaks his back, you must fill in for him, there\u2019s not much you need to learn and train, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One Man Pitstop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Minigames while racing to gain a minigame-appropriate Power-up and risk the chance of failing, where you will gain a power down. Are you able to multitask and gain the Title of Grease Monkey, or will you fall between the cracks of obscurity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Example:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uf0a7    Pick up the Minigame Box</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uf0a7    The slot machine will choose a minigame (e.g. TNT Minigame)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uf0a7    Mash Minigame Prompt to succeed, which drops a bomb behind you </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uf0a7    Enemy Racer Hits Bomb and Explodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uf0a7    Fail the minigame, and instead you\u2019ll blow up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which Car will you pick?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of cars with different Stats to pick from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race your Ghost</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your after-image ghost of your fastest lap will show up every race. can you beat yourself, or is that the best you can do?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race your Friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, Couch Co-op is included.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro Aesthetics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CRT? Check. Cell-Shading? Check. It looks gorgeous, and it took a long time to make.</p>",
    "short_description": "Start your engines, then fix them! Grease Monkey Grand Prix is a retro-styled party racer with style, edge and most of all, blazing speed! In a world where companies are too cheap to hire mechanics, fixing your car as you try and reach the end of the track is up to you!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
